seg-0376cf5f98f0 = This is <b>not</b> a validation. The paper fitted real precise science orbits of the named satellites (with their full gravity, drag and non-gravitational history); Kshana fits its own integrated orbit, evaluates the six added parameters as described above, and uses its own SISRE weights. The comparison shows the trend and the order of magnitude. The comparison on the same real orbits the paper fitted is <c1/> (since { "0.30" } the 22-parameter fit agrees there within the pre-registered factor { "1.5" }, on the paper's days and on eight held-out days).

